combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:20:- 对每个框架，首先确定缺口所在的边（上、下、左、右）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:21:- 将框架内部所有碎片沿缺口的反方向滑动（即远离缺口方向），直到碎片触碰框架的对侧内壁或已堆叠的碎片为止（类似重力效果，碎片保持自身形状不变）。滑动顺序为：距离对侧内壁最近的碎片先滑动。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:23:- 框架线条保持不变，缺口保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:25:Key insight: 缺口不是碎片的出口，而是\"重力方向\"的反向指示器——碎片向远离缺口的方向堆叠；第二层推理在于碎片最终颜色由所属框架决定，而非碎片原有颜色，解题者需要从多个样例中发现这一着色替换规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:86:Sort vertical bars by height and redistribute them across fixed colored slots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:94:- Rank original x-positions (slots) left to right.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:95:- Place the i-th shortest shape into the i-th leftmost slot, recoloring it to that slot's original color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:98:Key insight: Each slot keeps its x-position and color identity; only the bar silhouettes are redistributed among slots by height order.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:342:  \"dst\": \"left-to-right output block slots d with the same widths as the ordered source blocks\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed287049989/8/codegen_prompts/1.md:344:  \"transform\": \"copy each whole source block unchanged into its assigned output slot\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed885927800/1/des.md:71:- `description`：将网格中的\"钥匙\"形状与\"锁\"内的缺口配对——钥匙需旋转到恰好能嵌入缺口的朝向后填入，并用钥匙颜色重绘整个锁区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed885927800/1/des.md:74:  - \"锁\"是一个较大的单色实心矩形，其中挖去了一个不规则的连通缺口（缺口区域为 bg），缺口完全位于矩形内部、不接触矩形边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed885927800/1/des.md:75:  - \"钥匙\"是一个与某个锁的缺口形状相同但可能经过了 90°、180° 或 270° 旋转的小型单色形状，颜色与任何锁的矩形颜色都不同，位于