sking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:12:- `description`：根据封闭区域内部\"种子色块\"的形状，在区域边界上开出对应形状的缺口，然后将种子色块沿缺口方向推出区域外并紧贴边界放置。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:22:  - 第二层推理——开缺口：在标记像素所在的那条边框边上，以标记像素为锚点，沿该边方向扩展出与种子色块在\"垂直于推出方向\"上的投影宽度相同的缺口（将对应位置的边框像素移除，变为背景色）。缺口的位置使得种子色块沿推出方向平移时能恰好从缺口通过。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:23:  - 第三层推理——放置种子：将种子色块沿推出方向平移，直到其整体刚好位于边框外侧、紧贴缺口。种子在原边框内部的位置被清除为背景色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:25:- `Key insight`：边框上的同色标记像素同时编码了两个信息：推出方向（标记在哪条边）和缺口的横向对齐位置（标记的具体坐标）；缺口的宽度则由种子形状在垂直于推出方向上的投影决定，这要求解题者把种子形状与边框缺口建立几何对应关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:257:- bg, a grey structural color forming two components: a large rectangular frame (slot) and a smaller bar with upward projections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:258:- Colored pixels inside the slot mark target columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:261:- Move the bar upward into the slot so its bottom edge sits one cell above the slot's interior bottom.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:262:- Shift it horizontally so the bar's upward projections align column-wise with the colored pixels in the slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:265:Key insight: The bar's projections act as keys that must align with the colored-column \"locks\" in the slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:269:  \"summary\": \"Grey horizontal bars with upward projections move upward into semi-open grey slots, aligning projections with slot openings, then colored pixels within slots move upward to align vertically with the bar's projections\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:272:  \"dst\": \"semi-open grey slot region with downward colored vertical projections d\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:278:  \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: Identify grey bar s with upward projections and grey slot d with colored downward projections; Step 2: Move s upward into d such that s.projections fit into d.openings with projection-to-projection vertical alignment; Step 3: Move colored pixels upward so they align with bar projections, with bar bottom 1 cell above slot bottom\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:280:    \"projection-slot alignment\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:285:  \"notes\": \"The key geometric constraint: projections of the bar must align column-wise with the colored projections in the slot; movement distance varies based on projection lengths to achieve final alignment with 1-cell gap at bottom\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:287:  \"src2\": \"colored pixels c within the slot region\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:290:  \"path2\": \"move(c, direction='up') such that c.projections align vertically with s.projections and s.bottom_edge is 1 cell above slot.bottom_edge\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:196:  \"grid_shape\": \"canonical crop; root-level outside blobs occupy a 3x3 bg slot\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:237:  \"dst\": \"packed upper wide slots and lower tall slots in the same left-to-right order\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:238:  \"match_cond\": \"rank(s) == rank(d) for both the upper and lower slot sequences\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:239:  \"transform\": \"paint each rectangle twice: min(h,w) by max(h,w) top-aligned in the upper band, and max(h,w) by min(h,w) bottom-aligned in the lower band, with one background column between slots\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:331:Rotate each vertical bar's color one slot right and its height one slot left.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:336:- The ordered bar slots are read from left to right.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:340:- At slot i, use the color from the previous slot cyclically.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:341:- At slot i, use the height from the next slot cyclically.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/2.md:344:- Color and height are independent cyclic attributes of the ordered bar slots:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed719905968/4/codegen_prompts/7.md:362:  \"dst\": \"next clockwise grid-corner slot d\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:162:Sort vertical bars by height and redistribute them across fixed colored slots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:170:- Rank original x-positions (slots) left to right.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:171:- Place the i-th shortest shape into the i-th leftmost slot, recoloring it to that slot's original color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/7.md:174:Key insight: Each slot keeps its x-position and color identity; only the bar silhouettes are redistributed among slots by height order.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/6.md:222:  \"dst\": \"two vertical slots inside a new one-pixel blue frame\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/6.md:223:  \"transform\": \"rotate the whole input grid 90 degrees counterclockwise, copy it into both slots, and color each horizontal frame-row endpoint with the inferred background color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1612447035/1/codegen_prompts/6.md:331:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:12:- `description`：根据框架内部的彩色种子像素，沿框架缺口方向向外生长出与种子颜色对应的分支树，分支形态由框架形状决定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:14:  - 背景色为 black。网格中散布若干由 grey 像素构成的矩形框架（边框宽1像素），每个框架恰好有一个边上存在一个连续缺口（缺口宽度为2或3像素）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:18:  - 第一步（确定生长模板）：每个框架的内部空间形成一个矩形区域。将框架内部视为一个微型画布，种子像素在其中的相对位置决定了生长分支的结构。具体地，从缺口中心向外画一条垂直于缺口所在边的射线方向作为\"主干方向\"。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:19:  - 第二步（映射生长）：对框架内部每个种子像素，计算它相对于缺口中心在平行于缺口边方向上的偏移量 d（向左为负，向右为正，以像素为单位）。然后从缺口外侧起，沿主干方向画一条长度等于框架内部在主干方向上的尺寸的直线段，该线段在垂直于主干的方向上偏移 d 个像素。线段颜色为该种子的颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:22:- `Key insight`：框架的缺口方向决定生长的朝向，框架内部的纵深尺寸决定分支长度，种子在缺口平行方向上的偏移量决定分支的横向位置——框架本质上是一个\"生长指令编码器\"，将内部空间布局映射为外部的平行线束。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:121:Summarize the enclosed table slots by the single object color inside each slot, using the slot background color for empty slots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:124:- The most common color forms the outer background and all enclosed slot\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:127:  slots, ordered by their positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:128:- Each slot contains either no other color or exactly one object color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:135:- For each slot, output its unique non-background color if present; otherwise\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:146:  \"src\": \"enclosed 4-connected background-color slot components arranged as a rectangular table, each containing zero or one non-background object color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:147:  \"transform\": \"collapse each slot to one output pixel in row/column order: use the contained object color if present, otherwise use the background color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed309175298/4/codegen_prompts/1.md:148:  \"grid_shape\": \"number of slot rows x number of slot columns\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:226:Summarize the enclosed table slots by the single object color inside each slot, using the slot background color for empty slots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:229:- The most common color forms the outer background and all enclosed slot\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:232:  slots, ordered by their positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:233:- Each slot contains either no other color or exactly one object color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:240:- For each slot, output its unique non-background color if present; otherwise\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:251:  \"src\": \"enclosed 4-connected background-color slot components arranged as a rectangular table, each containing zero or one non-background object color\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1557639258/4/codegen_prompts/6.md:252:  \"transform\": \"collapse each slot to one output pixel in row/column order: use the contained object color if