/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:62:  \"dst\": \"semi-open grey slot region with downward colored vertical projections d\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:68:  \"multi_step\": \"Step 1: Identify grey bar s with upward projections and grey slot d with colored downward projections; Step 2: Move s upward into d such that s.projections fit into d.openings with projection-to-projection vertical alignment; Step 3: Move colored pixels upward so they align with bar projections, with bar bottom 1 cell above slot bottom\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:70:    \"projection-slot alignment\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:75:  \"notes\": \"The key geometric constraint: projections of the bar must align column-wise with the colored projections in the slot; movement distance varies based on projection lengths to achieve final alignment with 1-cell gap at bottom\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:77:  \"src2\": \"colored pixels c within the slot region\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:80:  \"path2\": \"move(c, direction='up') such that c.projections align vertically with s.projections and s.bottom_edge is 1 cell above slot.bottom_edge\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:59:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:92:- Extract connected hole regions inside the frame as slots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:93:- Match each piece to a slot by comparing block-level shapes under rotation/flip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval_new/seed1572225882/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:94:- Output th